# Added to @expo/fingerprint's defaults (which already skip android/build and .gradle).
#
# VS Code's Java/Gradle extension imports a generated android/ project and writes
# Eclipse/Buildship and Kotlin files into every native package it touches, under
# node_modules — and keeps writing them back after they are deleted. No clean install
# ever has them, so they made this machine's fingerprint disagree with the one EAS
# computes, and the build failed at "Configure expo-updates" with a runtime version
# mismatch (1.2.2 build 30, 1.2.3 build 32). None of them is source.
**/.settings/**/*
**/.project
**/.classpath
**/.kotlin/**/*
**/android/**/bin/**/*
**/*-gradle-plugin/**/bin/**/*
**/*-gradle-plugin/**/build/**/*
**/*-gradle-plugin/**/.gradle/**/*
